{{--
    The Akukas mark, converted from the Android launcher icon
    (app/src/main/res/drawable/ic_launcher_foreground.xml) rather than redrawn, so the web and the
    app cannot drift apart. Android's `pathData` is SVG path syntax, and the vector's <group>
    scale/translate maps to one SVG transform.

    Fills with currentColor so the page decides the colour per theme — the app's own dark palette
    lightens the terracotta to #ffb4a8 rather than keeping the light-mode value on a dark ground.
--}}
